  "body_html": "<h1>Best Response</h1>\n<p>For $\\epsilon\\ge 0$, the $\\epsilon$-best response correspondence of player\n$i$ is\n$$\n  BR_i^\\epsilon(s_{-i})\n  =\n  \\{s_i\\in S_i:\n    g_i(s_i,s_{-i})\\ge g_i(t_i,s_{-i})-\\epsilon\n    \\text{ for all } t_i\\in S_i\\}.\n$$\nThe ordinary best-response correspondence is $BR_i=BR_i^0$.</p>\n<p>In a finite game, MFoGT also extends best response to mixed strategies against\ncorrelated strategies of the opponents:\n$$\n  BR_i(\\theta_{-i})\n  =\n  \\{m_i\\in\\Delta(S_i):\n    g_i(m_i,\\theta_{-i})\\ge g_i(\\sigma_i,\\theta_{-i})\n    \\text{ for all } \\sigma_i\\in\\Delta(S_i)\\}.\n$$</p>",
  "proof_html": null,
